comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T20:50:17.622Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: all-status exact and conjunctive searches found no owner; canonical external report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/982"
  "2026-08-11T22:18:18.503Z","harness:codex","Evidence 2026-08-12: linked-test removal now preserves comma and equals characters, supports repeatable 1-based --remove-index, reports removed only for effective removals, and refuses zero matches with linked_test_remove_no_match instead of false success. CLI, SDK, MCP schema, help, completion, and background safety contracts are aligned. Exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, contract snapshot, packed dogfood, packed npx, and all external package smokes passed. Temporary acceptance added command=printf a,b=c, removed it exactly with removed:1, removed a second entry by index with removed:1, and observed the typed zero-match refusal."
  "2026-08-11T22:23:34.873Z","harness:codex","Packed Bun acceptance 2026-08-12: npm pack produced unbrained-pm-cli-2026.8.11.tgz and bunx --silent --bun --package <tarball> pm --json --no-extensions contracts --summary exited 0 with schema_version 4.7.0 and 56 command summaries. Registry-backed package-default bunx remains assigned to the post-publish verifier, because Bun does not accept a tarball path in its package-default shorthand."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T22:18:19.011Z","harness:codex","Lossless evidence mutation requires selectors that never reinterpret stored command delimiters, an index escape hatch tied to stable list order, and receipts that distinguish effective removal from a no-op refusal."
